---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="课题组内部资料中心 - 王小治课题组" activeNav="内部专区">
  <div class="internal-container">
    <div class="security-banner">
      <div class="shield-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
          <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Microsoft 365 身份验证受保护区域</h2>
        <p>本区域受 Cloudflare Zero Trust 动态安全访问控制，仅限扬州大学环境科学与工程学院王小治课题组在籍成员访问。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dashboard-grid">
      <div class="dash-card">
        <div class="card-icon blue">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
            <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
            <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
            <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>培养方案与规章制度</h3>
        <p>硕士/博士研究生培养流程、毕业论文格式规范、实验室安全操作守则。</p>
        <span class="status-badge">内部文档</span>
      </div>

      <div class="dash-card">
        <div class="card-icon green">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
            <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>仪器设备预约与操作 SOP</h3>
        <p>色谱仪、质谱仪、离心机及土壤理化分析标准作业指导书 (SOP) 与操作视频。</p>
        <span class="status-badge">在线查阅</span>
      </div>

      <div class="dash-card">
        <div class="card-icon amber">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
            <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
            <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>组会 PPT 与学术报告归档</h3>
        <p>历次组会汇报课件、文献选读笔记、专家讲座交流资料云端归档。</p>
        <span class="status-badge">云端共享</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .internal-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px 80px;
    }
    .security-banner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .shield-icon {
      color: #16a34a;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .security-banner h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #166534;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .security-banner p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #15803d;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .dashboard-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .dash-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .dash-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-color: #cbd5e1;
    }
    .card-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .card-icon.blue { background: #eff6ff; color: #2563eb; }
    .card-icon.green { background: #f0fdf4; color: #16a34a; }
    .card-icon.amber { background: #fefce8; color: #ca8a04; }
    .dash-card h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e293b;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .dash-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .status-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0284c7;
      background: #e0f2fe;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
